Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:31:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD vim visual selections so terminal panes can yank
 focused text

Command-mode visual keys track character, line, and block selections in the focused pane. Yanks copy the selected text through a one-shot OSC 52 terminal clipboard sequence so copied text is not replayed on later renders.
